e": "screen01.png", "id": "686837029678994", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035354_686837033012327_5993127014333897630_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gnNEfmCsGaEQ7kNvwGXQ-oL&_nc_oc=AdokbscfwrtZq24GrOBBLCVF5ScuQ0vlEmWb4zC4EawEs1PRBsslNbf85Ig6LwaiLqk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRVzUmRJUOCKAAiQVh7f8HuUYlcN6X2caoA2JnObpFJ8A&oe=6B0DA725"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Meta&TAFE_Anatomy_icon_2560x1440.png", "id": "816247259438010", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001702_816247262771343_7938637194561121858_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VrIURqQ25eQQ7kNvwHLHnJ0&_nc_oc=Adrj4rcTigHUQrbdAM6qIvupoaMzmKTnpefiPTNHCKdb_sQk_zR91IPm33Ch1KqhX0g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRTPOUTcPSy5DuRqKNkjI01-pVOKCfBjXdhpSkT6f12kQ&oe=6B0DABD3"}, "display_name": "Animal Anatomy Explorer", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Animal Anatomy is a standalone experience that allows players to learn about animal anatomy through open exploration of an anatomically accurate, multi-layered digital replica of animals. In this initial release, two mammals will be included, a dog and a bison/buffalo.\n\nThe experience also features an interactive quiz, which assesses the player\u2019s knowledge of the anatomy of said animal. Players are given feedback on the quiz in real-time and can learn through repetition as the questions in the quiz randomize each time it is taken. ", "short_description": "Animal Anatomy is a standalone experience that allows players to learn about animal anatomy through open exploration of an anatomically accurate, multi-layered digital replica of animals. In this initial release, two mammals will be included, a dog and a bison/buffalo."}]}, "developer_name": "TAFE NSW", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.tafensw.edu.au